[ ] Publish the minimal data workflow schemas =workflow-schemas ~ $Define only the current index JSON array, minimal action transaction request, and transaction result using Draft 2020-12 before binding production types to the wire shapes.$ !1 #019fdffc-b14e-7481-87eb-9a7a109dde47
